  "summary_en": "California AB 489 (Chapter 615, 2025) extends existing prohibitions on implying health-care licensure to developers and deployers of AI/GenAI systems. It bans AI advertising or functionality implying care or advice comes from a licensed human professional, with enforcement by licensing boards and each use counted as a separate violation.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Licensure-impersonation term bans apply to entities developing or deploying AI/GenAI systems.",
   "AI advertising or functionality implying advice is from a licensed natural person is prohibited.",
   "Enforced by the appropriate health care licensing board, including injunctions.",
   "Each use of a prohibited term is a separate violation.",
   "Adds Chapter 15.5 to the Business and Professions Code."
